Bind HIA source admission to canonical Git objects

Compare authenticated source streams with unreplaced committed blobs, ignore inherited Git overrides, and bind commit/tree metadata to one resolved object. Preserve two readers, every fixed source/support path, and all proof budgets. Retain all original source controls and add four explicit Git provenance controls.
